<section class="ns-section ns-process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
  <div class="ns-container ns-editorial-grid">
    <header class="ns-section-heading">
      <p class="sn-eyebrow"><span class="sn-eyebrow__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>Scope before work</p>
      <h2 id="process-title" class="t-heading">What the weeks look like</h2>
      <%= link_to studio_how_we_work_path, class: "ns-text-link" do %>
        How we work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <% end %>
    </header>
    <ol class="ns-process__steps" role="list">
      <li><span class="ns-process__number t-label" aria-hidden="true">01</span><p>You send the workflow through the form. I reply by email within two business days.</p></li>
      <li><span class="ns-process__number t-label" aria-hidden="true">02</span><p>A call. If I am the wrong person, or I cannot start, I say that.</p></li>
      <li><span class="ns-process__number t-label" aria-hidden="true">03</span><p>A written scope: price, duration, what is included, what is not, and the metric.</p></li>
      <li><span class="ns-process__number t-label" aria-hidden="true">04</span><p>Half to start. Work begins when access is actually available.</p></li>
      <li><span class="ns-process__number t-label" aria-hidden="true">05</span><p>Readout. You decide whether to stop, take a monthly plan, or scope the next piece.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
